026","VerseNumber":14,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَهُمۡ عَلَيَّ ذَنۢبٞ فَأَخَافُ أَن يَقۡتُلُونِ","TajweedText":"وَلَهُمْ عَلَىَّ ذَ<tajweed class=iqlab>نۢب</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>ٌ ف</tajweed>َأَخَافُ أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>تُل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>١٤</span>","End":"١٤","PageNumber":367,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":15,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ كَلَّاۖ فَٱذۡهَبَا بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآۖ إِنَّا مَعَكُم مُّسۡتَمِعُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ كَلَّا‌ۖ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ذْهَبَا بِـَٔـايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ‌ۖ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا مَعَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّسْتَمِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٥</span>","End":"١٥","PageNumber":367,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":16,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأۡتِيَا فِرۡعَوۡنَ فَقُولَآ إِنَّا رَسُولُ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","TajweedText":"فَأْتِيَا فِرْعَوْنَ فَقُول<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا رَسُولُ رَبِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٦</span>","End":"١٦","PageNumber":367,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":17,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَنۡ أَرۡسِلۡ مَعَنَا بَنِيٓ إِسۡرَـٰٓءِيلَ","TajweedText":"أَنْ أَرْسِلْ مَعَنَا بَن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> إِسْر<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َٲ</tajweed>ٓء<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>لَ <span class=end>١٧</span>","End":"١٧","PageNumber":367,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":18,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ أَلَمۡ نُرَبِّكَ فِينَا وَلِيدٗا وَلَبِثۡتَ فِينَا مِنۡ عُمُرِكَ سِنِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ أَلَمْ نُرَبِّكَ فِينَا وَلِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>دًا و</tajweed>َلَبِثْتَ فِينَا مِنْ عُمُرِكَ سِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٨</span>","End":"١٨","PageNumber":367,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":19,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَفَعَلۡتَ فَعۡلَتَكَ ٱلَّتِي فَعَلۡتَ وَأَنتَ مِنَ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ","TajweedText":"وَفَعَلْتَ فَعْلَتَكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّتِى فَعَلْتَ وَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٩</span>","End":"١٩","PageNumber":367,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":20,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَعَلۡتُهَآ إِذٗا وَأَنَا۠ مِنَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَعَلْتُه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ذًا و</tajweed>َأَنَا۟ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ضّ<tajweed class=madda_necessary>َا</tajweed>ٓلّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٠</span>","End":"٢٠","