26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":24,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبُّ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآۖ إِن كُنتُم مُّوقِنِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبُّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ‌ۖ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّوقِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٤</span>","End":"٢٤","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ لِمَنۡ حَوۡلَهُۥٓ أَلَا تَسۡتَمِعُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ لِمَنْ حَوْلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> أَلَا تَسْتَمِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبُّكُمۡ وَرَبُّ ءَابَآئِكُمُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبُّكُمْ وَرَبُّ ءَاب<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَوَّل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":27,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ إِنَّ رَسُولَكُمُ ٱلَّذِيٓ أُرۡسِلَ إِلَيۡكُمۡ لَمَجۡنُونٞ","TajweedText":"قَالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ رَسُولَكُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أُرْسِلَ إِلَيْكُمْ لَمَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>ن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>٢٧</span>","End":"٢٧","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":28,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ رَبُّ ٱلۡمَشۡرِقِ وَٱلۡمَغۡرِبِ وَمَا بَيۡنَهُمَآۖ إِن كُنتُمۡ تَعۡقِلُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ رَبُّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَشْرِقِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَغْرِبِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ‌ۖ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَعْقِل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٨</span>","End":"٢٨","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":29,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ لَئِنِ ٱتَّخَذۡتَ إِلَٰهًا غَيۡرِي لَأَجۡعَلَنَّكَ مِنَ ٱلۡمَسۡجُونِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ لَئِنِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخَذْتَ إِلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هًا غَيْرِى لَأَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>عَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَسْجُون<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٩</span>","End":"٢٩","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":30,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ أَوَلَوۡ جِئۡتُكَ بِشَيۡءٖ مُّبِينٖ","TajweedText":"قَالَ أَوَلَوْ جِئْتُكَ بِش<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َىْءٍ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٣٠</span>","End":"٣٠","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":31,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَأۡتِ بِهِۦٓ إِن كُنتَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَأْتِ بِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>َ مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>صَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣١</span>","End":"٣١","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":32,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَلۡقَىٰ عَصَاهُ فَإِذَا هِيَ ثُعۡبَانٞ مُّبِينٞ","TajweedText":"فَأَلْقَىٰ عَصَاهُ فَإِذَا هِىَ ثُعْبَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٌ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>٣٢</span>","End":"٣٢","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَزَعَ يَدَهُۥ فَإِذَا هِيَ بَيۡضَآءُ لِلنَّـٰظِرِينَ","TajweedText":"وَنَزَعَ يَدَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> فَإِذَا هِىَ بَيْض<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُ لِل<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ظِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":317,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ لِلۡمَلَإِ حَوۡلَهُۥٓ إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَسَٰحِرٌ عَلِيمٞ","TajweedText":"قَالَ لِلْمَلَإِ حَوْلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذَا لَسَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>حِرٌ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يُرِيدُ أَن يُخۡرِجَكُم مِّنۡ أَرۡضِكُم بِسِحۡرِهِۦ فَمَاذَا تَأۡمُرُونَ","TajweedText":"يُرِيدُ أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُخْرِجَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْ أَرْضِك<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِسِحْرِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> فَمَاذَا تَأْمُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":36,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُوٓاْ أَرۡجِهۡ وَأَخَاهُ وَٱبۡعَثۡ فِي ٱلۡمَدَآئِنِ حَٰشِرِينَ","TajweedText":"قَال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَرْجِهْ وَأَخَاهُ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>عَثْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَد<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓئِنِ حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>شِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٦</span>","End":"٣٦","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":37,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَأۡتُوكَ بِكُلِّ سَحَّارٍ عَلِيمٖ","TajweedText":"يَأْتُوكَ بِكُلِّ سَحَّارٍ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٍ <span class=end>٣٧</span>","End":"٣٧","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":38,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَجُمِعَ ٱلسَّحَرَةُ لِمِيقَٰتِ يَوۡمٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","TajweedText":"فَجُمِعَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّحَرَةُ لِمِيقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِ يَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٍ م</tajweed>َّعْل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>مٍ <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقِيلَ لِلنَّاسِ هَلۡ أَنتُم مُّجۡتَمِعُونَ","TajweedText":"وَقِيلَ لِل<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َاسِ هَلْ أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ُّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>تَمِع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":368,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَعَلَّنَا نَتَّبِعُ ٱلسَّحَرَةَ إِن كَانُواْ هُمُ ٱلۡغَٰلِبِينَ","TajweedText":"لَعَلَّنَا نَتَّبِعُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّحَرَةَ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِب<tajweed class=madda_permi