weed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>فٍ و</tajweed>َلَأُصَلِّبَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ أَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>مَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٩</span>","End":"٤٩","PageNumber":369,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":50,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ لَا ضَيۡرَۖ إِنَّآ إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا مُنقَلِبُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> لَا ضَيْرَ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَىٰ رَبِّنَا مُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نق</tajweed>َلِب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٠</span>","End":"٥٠","PageNumber":369,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":26,"SurahIndex":"026","VerseNumber":51,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّا نَطۡمَعُ أَن يَغۡفِرَ لَنَا رَبُّنَا خَطَٰيَٰنَآ أَن كُنَّآ أَوَّلَ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا نَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed>مَعُ أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َغْفِرَ لَنَا رَبُّنَا خَطَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ن<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>ُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَوَّلَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُؤْمِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥١</span>","End":"٥١","PageNumber":369,"JuzNumber":19,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":318,"MaqraNumber":147,"HizbNumber":37,"HizbDecimal":0.5,"HasSajda":false}]}